      "published": "Wed, 02 Sep 2026 20:22:31 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "On Wednesday, the Trump administration threw its support behind OpenAI, backing the AI giant in its ongoing litigation with The New York Times. The Department of Justice voiced its support through a statement of interest (SOI) filed with the Manhattan judge overseeing the case, which includes several other plaintiffs, including daily papers owned by Alden...",
      "source": "Nieman Lab"
    },
    {
