      "link": "https://www.niemanlab.org/2026/09/how-one-newsletter-writer-is-building-a-subscription-business-when-paywalls-dont-really-work/",
      "published": "Wed, 02 Sep 2026 17:08:43 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "A year ago, a spirited and public-records-powered newsletter needed a mascot. Sleuthy the Seal — born of a &#8220;fortuitous misunderstanding&#8221; — was created. Journalist and newsletter founder David Covucci promised his wife he&#8217;d get the plucky mascot tattooed if he could hit 500 subscribers with the solo venture. The football helmet-wearing seal quickly had a...",
      "source": "Nieman Lab"
    },
